Cool. I propose this wording:
&#39;$12 commission + $1,250 prize draw ticket has gone to your chosen *From Workshop Floor to Fresh Start* NFT holder&#39;
It would appear in the &#39;Mint successful&#39; modal whenever a code is used.

Here is the query with the contract filter applied:
{
block {
timestamp,
number,
hash,
\# For log filtering, replace the placeholder contract address
logs(filter: {addresses: \["0x8A3c19D4e725B601Ff48aC930d2E67b514C09F6e"\]}) {
topics,
data,
index,
transaction {
status,
hash,
nonce,
index,
value,
gas,
gasUsed,
cumulativeGasUsed,
gasPrice,
effectiveGasPrice,
maxFeePerGas,
maxPriorityFeePerGas,
from { address },
to { address },
createdContract { address }
},
account { address }
}
}
}
